    "updated_at": "2020-10-05T08:46:20Z",
    "body": "I think encouraging naming for optional arguments is reasonable, but I'm okay with not endorsing anything for now, especially as there is no tooling support either.\r\n\r\nWe could use `<i>` at the call site instead of `<var>`.",
