    "created_at": "2020-10-06T08:13:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-10-06T08:13:12Z",
    "body": "With `<var>` you have to work around it not-really-being-a-var with `<var ignore>`. With `<i>` you don't need to work around it, so it gets my vote.",
